# Keep bulky local artifacts out of player images. The build context is the
# repo root and the crewborg Dockerfile COPYs the whole `players` tree; without
# this file the 1.2 GB `episode_data` eval archive was baked into the image,
# pushing pulls past Crewrift's 30 s connect window on cold k8s nodes (lobby
# no-show -> -100 for everyone in-lobby; found during the 2026-06-11 v4/v5
# uploads).
**/episode_data/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
logs/
**/*.bitreplay
**/*.json.z
.git/
